	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0301_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ
ホテル　リッチホドモエ　です▼
あいにく　まんしつで　ございますが
ごゆるりと　くつろいで　くださいませ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:36:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:36:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ
ホテル　リッチホドモエ　です▼
あいにく　満室で　ございますが
ごゆるりと　くつろいで　くださいませ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T05:51:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:36:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・GRIDX＝7、GRIDZ＝2
・swanで追加</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:36:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>INFORMATIONW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:36:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
